{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/891410-telepathic-communications","id":891410,"title":"Telepathic communications","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-15T15:30:18-07:00","id":891410,"title":"Telepathic communications","content":"I know that animal covers have the ability to speak, without speaking. Can angel's or demon's generally do this? are there any powers that allow them to?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T16:02:40-07:00","id":891426,"title":"","content":"Angels are capable of communication with anyone by essentially broadcasting their words into people's minds. Demons cannot do this without other suoernatural powers, but to compensate they can speak any native language that is currently in use by a society ( though all demons lose access to languages that have no native, fluent speakers)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T09:56:02-07:00","id":891823,"title":"","content":"Special Message and Across A Crowded room are both similar to telepathic communication in some ways. You could easily make an Interlock to do precisely this using those two Embeds, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T10:17:45-07:00","id":891840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/891410-telepathic-communications?p=891823#post891823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Special Message and Across A Crowded room are both similar to telepathic communication in some ways. You could easily make an Interlock to do precisely this using those two Embeds, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean the Storyteller could easily make the interlock riight? lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-19T09:53:47-07:00","id":894120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/891410-telepathic-communications?p=891840#post891840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You mean the Storyteller could easily make the interlock riight? lol</div> </div> </div> </div>I made two Interlocks for this. I don't have my notes with me right now but the gist of it was this:<br /> <br /> The first didn't really create telepathy but it did do something similar.<br /> &quot;In Your Eyes&quot;<br /> The Demon can share the vision of a number of subjects that it touches (with more starting to cost Aether and a lot starting to need compromise). The general use was so that a scout could run ahead while those doing other things were instantly aware of pertinent things happening to the scout. They could indirectly communicate by &quot;hearing&quot; through the other's body.<br /> <br /> &quot;One of Us&quot;<br /> Essentially created a hive mind with those that the Demon Touches. Basically all the thought patterns were linked. All actions taken by any of the bodies in the net had to be agreed on with all (with a disagreement causing an action as close to a middle ground as possible)<br /> <br /> The latter was really fun as I hadn't anticipated the Interlock being used cleverly as an actual weapon, and also as a drawback as a dramatic failure caused the PC to be stuck in the antagonist's mind and body as it was ripped to shreds. Even for a Demon that was massively traumatic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T00:12:25-07:00","id":895363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/891410-telepathic-communications?p=894120#post894120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I made two Interlocks for this. I don't have my notes with me right now but the gist of it was this:<br /> <br /> The first didn't really create telepathy but it did do something similar.<br /> &amp;quot;In Your Eyes&amp;quot;<br /> The Demon can share the vision of a number of subjects that it touches (with more starting to cost Aether and a lot starting to need compromise). The general use was so that a scout could run ahead while those doing other things were instantly aware of pertinent things happening to the scout. They could indirectly communicate by &amp;quot;hearing&amp;quot; through the other's body.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;One of Us&amp;quot;<br /> Essentially created a hive mind with those that the Demon Touches. Basically all the thought patterns were linked. All actions taken by any of the bodies in the net had to be agreed on with all (with a disagreement causing an action as close to a middle ground as possible)<br /> <br /> The latter was really fun as I hadn't anticipated the Interlock being used cleverly as an actual weapon, and also as a drawback as a dramatic failure caused the PC to be stuck in the antagonist's mind and body as it was ripped to shreds. Even for a Demon that was massively traumatic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those are pretty clever","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}